{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":27,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"[Blackguard].","id":"4c0be1e4-9c8d-5d26-96a1-833485cd70d5"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":28,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"Most people probably didn’t even see the [Blackguard], hence him not being called out to by the [Hawkers] lined up around the city gates.","id":"2a92b4b2-77c6-5ed1-b3c7-19ec9e8364b5"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":29,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"He caught the two unawares; the woman was speaking to the [Blackguard] without turning her head as she flipped off a [Hawker].","id":"4719a82c-a85f-57a6-b354-79fff15e4f92"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":29,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"The [Blackguard] had already seen him and just warily stepped between the two.","id":"7ef83026-14db-5673-99a4-7ae85a970927"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":32,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"The [Blackguard] was a silent shadow, unheard but never forgotten by either.","id":"94980b46-694b-59e1-8426-401dedaafcdd"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":43,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"She gestured to the [Blackguard] with her head.","id":"c8333dd7-7e40-5b24-bffd-1b9d01a79340"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":57,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"She nodded to the [Blackguard], and the man reached for something concealed by his clothing.","id":"de723afc-5d00-5016-9005-3038528d6137"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":57,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"He looked from the [Nightstalker], whose crossed arms meant she was ready to draw, and then at the [Blackguard] hovering over his shoulder, already holding his weapon.","id":"6d176ce9-1dce-5be2-a766-acac5f354921"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":59,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"The Sister of Chell’s eyes widened, and the [Blackguard] moved.","id":"11afdefa-efe7-5b6c-bf66-79ccc5986a71"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":62,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"Rattled, the [Nightstalker] looked at the [Blackguard].","id":"024a12ef-8c0e-5a62-9e65-b9c4ff03b7b9"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":65,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"He followed her, and the [Blackguard] trailed the two.","id":"e9ab7b15-73e5-54fe-bd42-621b291fb4bb"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":101,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"To the [Enforcer], the [Nightstalker], and probably the silent [Blackguard], it was as obvious as the sun what was going down.","id":"693858b5-6a46-51e0-ab86-610f58584d79"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":122,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"The Sister of Chell recoiled, and the [Blackguard] twitched.","id":"b7441cc8-dedb-5bbc-a853-f8064cf711b0"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":144,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"They didn’t notice the [Blackguard].","id":"f039ce6b-a742-584e-9d1f-a4ab5cd6d2cf"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":160,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"Lucky for the man too; the [Blackguard] would have stopped it far less kindly.","id":"41f34c06-56c9-5e9f-b7ab-c4cd9c026a66"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":164,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"The Sister of Chell and [Blackguard] saw the [Enforcer] slowly adjusting his hat.","id":"3fc2678a-f416-51ca-82a0-bb8d39a5b4e6"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":167,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"the hand holding it moved so fast that only the [Enforcer] and the [Blackguard] saw its path.","id":"00a4ca83-22de-567f-83b7-5d8fa3fa305f"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":167,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"Then the pain came, and the man’s eyes bulged, and he opened his mouth. But the [Blackguard], who’d slipped behind him, grabbed him.","id":"1dfd6d89-564a-5a83-8f1c-e1c449b95fe4"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":168,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"Then she pointed at the [Blackguard].","id":"70eccbba-ceaf-57cd-a295-896f6a5ef146"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":170,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"The [Blackguard] let go, wrinkling his nose, and walked behind the [Nightstalker].","id":"abd3c384-8129-5af8-a32b-48ef53cd4ac9"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":201,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"The [Blackguard] followed, and the pale-faced group stared as the [Enforcer] tipped his hat.","id":"bcecee9c-f56a-5385-b76c-8cb27efc7b00"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":217,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"The [Nightstalker] jerked a head at the [Blackguard].","id":"f31f26cb-59f6-5b7f-b0ba-84b3e5459f73"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":247,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"She glared, and the [Blackguard], sensing that this might be the start of a long day, decided it was time to eat.","id":"ffb7a022-4b70-53d3-a599-b11228900775"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Numbtongue (Pt-1)","paragraph":248,"wording":"[Blackguard]","event":"named","holder-slug":"blackguard","holder-quote":"The [Blackguard] silently poured her a drink from his flask, and she sipped it.","id":"e3c6cbba-0bbc-59f8-9e82-1aec37be0bc6"}
